<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Hyd To Del Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to send furniture from HYD to DEL?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average door‑to‑door transit time for sending furniture from HYD to DEL is 22‑28 hours, depending on traffic, weather, and checkpoint clearance. Our dedicated multi‑axle container trucks travel the 850 km highway corridor non‑stop, with real‑time GPS updates that keep customers informed of any delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity move between Hyderabad and Delhi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shippers must provide a valid government‑issued ID, a signed consignment note, GST‑registered invoice (if applicable), and a copy of the e‑Way bill generated for the cargo. For corporate or government transfers, additional approval letters may be needed. All paperwork is verified at each checkpost to ensure smooth clearance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my furniture insured during the HYD‑DEL transit and what does the coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. The policy protects against loss, theft, accidental damage, and natural calamities throughout the journey. A detailed insurance certificate is provided before loading, and claims are processed within 48 hours if any incident occurs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are heavy items like sofas and wardrobes loaded onto the specialized container trucks on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our trained crew uses hydraulic loading ramps and high‑tensile ratchet lashings to secure heavy furniture onto the 32‑ft MX containers. Wheel chocks are placed for two‑wheelers, while custom wooden crates protect fragile pieces. Each item is documented, photographed, and stacked following weight‑distribution guidelines to prevent movement during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the cost of sending furniture from HYD to DEL?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is driven by total volume (cubic feet), weight, distance, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any optional services such as extra padding or white‑glove handling. Seasonal demand, road tolls, and special handling for delicate items (e.g., glassware, artwork) also affect the final tariff shown in the cost matrix.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time while it moves from HYD to DEL?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each container truck is equipped with satellite‑GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. Shippers receive a unique tracking ID and can view the exact position, estimated arrival time, and checkpoint status on a map interface, ensuring full visibility from pickup to delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions or prohibited items when sending furniture from HYD to DEL?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, hazardous materials such as flammable liquids, explosives, and chemicals are prohibited. Perishable food items, live animals, and unregistered firearms cannot be transported. Additionally, items exceeding the legal height or width limits for highway transport must be declared in advance for special permits.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
